      "raw": "<p>Top Ten List of Things I Hope to Never See In The Multiverse</p><p>A moment of silliness insprited by reading Abstract Studio&#39;s version of Number 10</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol><li>The Naturalist Steampunk rebrand</li><li>The humanizing story about Baron Blade&rsquo;s love of puppies</li><li>K.N.Y.F.E. changing her name to Danger Imminent - Reaction Killin&rsquo;</li><li>Absolute Zero vodka product placement</li><li>Akash&#39;bhuta, the computer hacker rebrand</li><li>Visionary psychedelic 3D Comics*</li><li>The Six Million Dollar Mr. Fixer</li><li>Parse and Fanatic go on a drive down Route 66 trying to find America. Neither really relates to normal people very well.</li><li>Storylines about Tyler Vance being too *ahem* attached to his Bunker suit</li><li>Easy Readers featuring the Freedom Five-Year-Olds</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Unless done by J. H. Williams III</p>",
